%      manuscript that cites \citep{mythril} therefore means a work that is not
%      in this file -- check every occurrence.
%  (2) ALIASES FOLDED.  The same work carried two keys across the manuscripts.
%      The canonical key is kept; the alias is NOT defined:
%        pulse            -> smartpulse   (Stephens et al., S&P 2021)
%        accountingerrors -> sctype       (Zhang, ICSE 2024)
%        gpt              -> chatgpt      (OpenAI ChatGPT)
